#: ../../../release/dev/externalproject-install-prefix.rst:2
msgid "externalproject-install-prefix"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release/dev/externalproject-install-prefix.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :command:`ExternalProject_Add` command now sets :variable:"
"`CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX` to the external project's ``INSTALL_DIR`` in its "
"default configure command, so a CMake external project installs into the "
"prefix the module reserves for it rather than the built-in default (e.g. ``/"
"usr/local``). A caller-supplied prefix still takes precedence. See policy :"
"policy:`CMP0225`."
msgstr ""
